## Conflict resolution

When **`UI Design Weekend Grills/`** conflicts with globals or boilerplate defaults, **prioritize the design folder** after confirming it is current; otherwise keep Tropical Barbeque tokens in `globals.css` and reconcile in a PR-sized change (don’t silently revert theme).
